  "description": "Premium payment schedule of a swap contract: the participant informs the number of premium events, their payment dates and amounts. Generated by the New Deals › Swap › Bullet page together with the 0301 contract record whenever the Deal Ticket carries Agenda de Prêmio = Sim — one file per view (client; Bank and Atacama in the B2B).",
  "file_name_rule": "PREMIO_CLIENTE.txt / PREMIO_BANCO.txt / PREMIO_ATACAMA.txt by view (a `file_name` registered on the variant of the pair wins), written by the Send button into the Batch Conecta › New folder next to the SWAP_*.txt of the same deal; an existing name gets a \" (n)\" copy suffix.",
  "notes": "Record length 52. Header (line 0) + one Registro (line 1) per contract + one Dados do Fluxo line per premium event (the page emits ONE event). Meu Número Operação Reg. Contrato = the Meu Número of the 0301 record of the same view; Papel = the PONTA of the Parte (00 for the smaller account number, 01 for the larger — manual 4.2.12); Titular of the flow = the ponta of the premium PAYER, by the same criterion.",
